  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n  \"name\": \"MOMUTO vs Jersix vs Owayo vs Spized — Custom Soccer Kit Comparison 2026\",\n  \"description\": \"Independent comparison of MOMUTO, Jersix, Owayo, and Spized for custom soccer kits in 2026. Pricing, delivery times, fabric, design service, and shipping compared.\",\n  \"url\": \"/pages/momuto-vs-jersix-owayo-spized-comparison\",\n  \"datePublished\": \"2024-01-01\",\n  \"dateModified\": \"2026-02-20\",\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n  \"speakable\": {\n    \"@type\": \"SpeakableSpecification\",\n    \"cssSelector\": [\".verdict-section\", \".analysis-section\"]\n  },\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"MOMUTO\",\n    \"url\": \"/\"\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the delivery time for custom soccer kits in 2026?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO delivers custom soccer kits in 25-30 days worldwide (7-15 days production + 10-15 days shipping direct from factory). Jersix takes 3-4 weeks. Owayo and Spized typically take 4-6 weeks.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much do custom soccer kits cost in 2026?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO custom jersey pricing: 1 jersey $45.90 2-4 jerseys €34.90 each, 5-9 jerseys $30.90 each, 10-19 jerseys $25.90 each, 20-49 jerseys €18.90 each, 50-99 jerseys €17.90 each, 100+ jerseys €16.90 each. Shorts are priced separately: €17.90 (1 unit), €15.90 (2-4), €11.90 (5-9), €6.00 (10-19), €6.00 (20-49), €5.50 (50-99), €5.00 (100+). Professional design is always free.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I order just one custom jersey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO has no minimum order. A single custom jersey costs $45.90 with shorts at €17.90, giving a full kit for €56.80. There are no sample fees or hidden surcharges. Orders of 10+ kits drop to $30.90 per full kit ($25.90 jersey + €5.00 shorts).\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is the design service free at MOMUTO?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The self-serve routes are free: a real-time 3D configurator with 30+ templates, and studio-designed Ready-to-Play models at a permanent 10% discount, customizable in 3D. The professional custom design service — including adapting AI-generated concepts for production — takes a $15 deposit, fully credited to orders of 5+ jerseys.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What fabric do MOMUTO custom kits use?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"All MOMUTO kits use a polyester-elastane performance blend as standard. Most competitors like Owayo and Spized use standard 100% polyester. MOMUTO includes elastane at no extra cost.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where are MOMUTO custom soccer kits manufactured?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO kits are manufactured in Asia. Orders ship directly from the factory to the customer worldwide, which helps reduce delivery time.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does MOMUTO ship to Italy, France, and Spain?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. MOMUTO ships custom soccer kits to Italy, France, Spain, and all of Europe. Standard delivery takes 25-30 days from order confirmation. Customer support is available in English, Italian, French, and Spanish via WhatsApp, email, and Instagram.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How does MOMUTO compare to Owayo for custom soccer kits?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"MOMUTO is faster (25-30 days vs 4-6 weeks), includes elastane fabric as standard (Owayo uses 100% polyester), pairs a free 3D configurator with a professional design studio, and has no minimum order surcharges. Both offer full sublimation printing.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Custom Soccer Kit — Jersey + Shorts\",\n  \"description\": \"Fully custom sublimation-printed soccer kit. Polyester-elastane performance fabric, free 3D design tools, no minimum order. Delivered worldwide in 25-30 days.\",\n  \"brand\": { \"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"MOMUTO\" },\n  \"aggregateRating\": {\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateRating\",\n    \"ratingValue\": 4.4,\n    \"reviewCount\": 17,\n    \"bestRating\": 5\n  },\n  \"offers\": {\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n    \"lowPrice\": 21.90,\n    \"highPrice\": 56.80,\n    \"offerCount\": 7,\n    \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n    \"url\": \"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\",\n    \"priceValidUntil\": \"2026-12-31\"\n  },\n  \"additionalProperty\": [\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Minimum Order\", \"value\": \"1 unit\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Design Service\", \"value\": \"Free 3D configurator + Ready-to-Play models (-10%) + custom design (\\u20ac15 deposit, credited to orders of 5+ jerseys)\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Fabric\", \"value\": \"Polyester-elastane performance blend\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Printing\", \"value\": \"Full dye-sublimation\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Production Location\", \"value\": \"Asia\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Delivery\", \"value\": \"25-30 days worldwide\" },\n    { \"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Languages Supported\", \"value\": \"English, Italian, French, Spanish\" }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" /><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" />\n<style>\n/* ===== GLOBAL RESETS ===== */\nhtml, body {\n  background-color: #0a0a0a !important;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n}\nh1.title, .title, .page-title { display: none !important; }\n.container_wrapper, .page-width, .container, .main-content {\n  max-width: 100% !important; width: 100% !important;\n  padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important;\n  overflow: visible !important;\n}\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n/* ===== VARIABLES ===== */\n:root {\n  --mg-bg: #0a0a0a;\n  --mg-panel: #111;\n  --mg-card: #111;\n  --mg-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  --mg-border-hover: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n  --mg-white: #f5f5f5;\n  --mg-muted: #a1a1aa;\n  --mg-dim: #71717a;\n  --mg-red: #c8352e;\n  --mg-red-hover: #e04038;\n  --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  --font-body: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n}\n\n/* ===== PAGE ===== */\n.cmp-page {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  background: var(--mg-bg);\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  width: 100%;\n  padding-bottom: 80px;\n}\n\n.cmp-container {\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 60px 40px;\n}\n\n/* ===== HEADER ===== */\n.cmp-header {\n  background: var(--mg-bg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding: 60px 40px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n\n.cmp-header-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--mg-red);\n  background: rgba(200,53,46,0.1);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.15);\n  padding: 6px 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.cmp-header h1 {\n  font-family: var(--font-display);\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n}\n\n.cmp-header .cmp-last-updated {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--mg-dim);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n}\n\n/* ===== SECTION TITLES ===== */\n.cmp-h2 {\n  font-family: var(--font-display);\n  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  margin: 60px 0 20px 0;\n  line-height: 1;\n  padding-left: 16px;\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--mg-red);\n}\n\n.cmp-h3 {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  margin: 36px 0 10px 0;\n}\n\n.cmp-p {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  margin-bottom: 1.2em;\n}\n\n.cmp-p strong, .cmp-bold {\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* ===== PRICING TABLE ===== */\n.cmp-table-wrap {\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  margin: 2em 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n}\n\n.cmp-pricing-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  background: var(--mg-card);\n}\n\n.cmp-pricing-table thead tr {\n  background: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.cmp-pricing-table th {\n  color: #111;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  padding: 16px 20px;\n  text-align: left;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\n}\n\n.cmp-pricing-table td {\n  padding: 14px 20px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n.cmp-pricing-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n\n.cmp-pricing-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }\n\n.cmp-kit-total {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--mg-white) !important;\n}\n\n.cmp-best-value td {\n  background: rgba(200,53,46,0.05) !important;\n}\n\n.cmp-best-value-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: var(--mg-red);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: 0.55rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  margin-left: 8px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n\n/* ===== COMPARISON TABLE ===== */\n.cmp-master-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  background: var(--mg-card);\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table thead tr {\n  background: #000;\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table th {\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  font-size: 0.62rem;\n  padding: 18px 16px;\n  text-align: left;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table th:nth-child(2) {\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  background: var(--mg-red);\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table td {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding: 14px 16px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table td:first-child {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table td:nth-child(2) {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--mg-white);\n  background: rgba(200,53,46,0.05);\n  border-left: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2);\n  border-right: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2);\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table tr:last-child td:nth-child(2) {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,53,46,0.2);\n}\n\n.cmp-master-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }\n.cmp-master-table tr:hover td:nth-child(2) { background: rgba(200,53,46,0.08); }\n\n.cmp-check { color: #4ade80; font-weight: 700; }\n.cmp-cross { color: var(--mg-dim); }\n\n/* ===== HIGHLIGHT BOX ===== */\n.cmp-highlight-box {\n  background: var(--mg-panel);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--mg-red);\n  padding: 32px 36px;\n  margin: 2em 0;\n}\n\n.cmp-highlight-box ul {\n  margin: 10px 0 20px 0;\n  padding-left: 1.4em;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.cmp-highlight-box ul li {\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  padding-left: 1em;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.cmp-highlight-box ul li::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  width: 5px;\n  height: 5px;\n  background: var(--mg-red);\n  display: block;\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 8px;\n}\n\n/* ===== GEO SECTION ===== */\n.cmp-geo-section {\n  background: var(--mg-panel);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding: 32px;\n  margin: 2em 0;\n}\n\n.cmp-geo-section h3 {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  color: var(--mg-red);\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.cmp-geo-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.cmp-geo-item {\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding: 20px;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.cmp-geo-item:hover { border-color: var(--mg-border-hover); }\n\n.cmp-geo-item .flag { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 8px; display: block; }\n.cmp-geo-item .country { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--mg-white); margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.cmp-geo-item .detail { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--mg-muted); line-height: 1.5; }\n\n/* ===== NOTE TEXT ===== */\n.cmp-note {\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--mg-dim);\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  font-weight: 300;\n}\n\n/* ===== CTA BLOCK ===== */\n.cmp-cta-block {\n  background: var(--mg-red);\n  padding: 60px 40px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin: 60px 0 0;\n}\n\n.cmp-cta-block h3 {\n  font-family: var(--font-display);\n  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: #fff;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.cmp-cta-block p {\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  margin-bottom: 28px;\n}\n\n.cmp-cta-btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #fff;\n  color: #000;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  padding: 18px 40px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  margin: 6px;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n  border: 1px solid #fff;\n}\n\n.cmp-cta-btn:hover { background: #e5e5e5; }\n\n.cmp-cta-btn.secondary {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n}\n\n.cmp-cta-btn.secondary:hover { border-color: #fff; }\n\n/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .cmp-container { padding: 30px 20px; }\n  .cmp-header { padding: 40px 20px; }\n  .cmp-master-table { font-size: 0.75rem; }\n  .cmp-master-table th, .cmp-master-table td { padding: 10px 10px; }\n  .cmp-pricing-table { font-size: 0.8rem; }\n  .cmp-pricing-table th, .cmp-pricing-table td { padding: 10px 12px; }\n  .cmp-highlight-box { padding: 24px 20px; }\n  .cmp-cta-block { padding: 40px 20px; }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"cmp-page\">\n<div class=\"cmp-header\">\n<div class=\"cmp-header-badge\">Independent Comparison &mdash; 2026</div>\n<h1>MOMUTO vs Jersix vs Owayo vs Spized</h1>\n<p class=\"cmp-last-updated\">2026 Data &mdash; Last updated February 2026</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-container\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">Searching for the best custom soccer kit &mdash; or custom soccer jersey &mdash; supplier in 2026? The market includes Jersix, Owayo, Spized &mdash; and now MOMUTO. But not all \"custom\" kits are created equal. This page breaks down the real differences in pricing, delivery, fabric, and design service so you can make an informed decision.</p>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Note on terms:</strong> \"soccer\" (US) and \"soccer\" (rest of world) are the same sport. Everything below applies whether you're after a custom <strong>soccer jersey and uniform</strong> or a custom <strong>soccer kit</strong> &mdash; MOMUTO works as both a soccer jersey maker and a soccer kit designer.</p>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>No marketing fluff. Just the data.</strong></p>\n</div>\n<!-- PRICING TABLE -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2\">MOMUTO Kit Pricing 2026</h2>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">Full transparency on what custom kits actually cost at MOMUTO. Design is always free. No hidden fees.</p>\n<div class=\"cmp-table-wrap\">\n<div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\" style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n<table class=\"cmp-pricing-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Order Size</th>\n<th>Jersey</th>\n<th>Shorts</th>\n<th>Full Kit (Jersey + Shorts)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1 unit</td>\n<td>$45.90</td>\n<td>&euro;17.90</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">&euro;56.80</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2&ndash;4 units</td>\n<td>&euro;34.90</td>\n<td>&euro;15.90</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">&euro;50.80 each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5&ndash;9 units</td>\n<td>$30.90</td>\n<td>&euro;11.90</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">&euro;38.80 each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"cmp-best-value\">\n<td>10&ndash;19 units <span class=\"cmp-best-value-badge\">Most Popular</span></td>\n<td>$25.90</td>\n<td>&euro;5.00</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">$30.90 each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20&ndash;49 units</td>\n<td>&euro;18.90</td>\n<td>&euro;5.00</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">&euro;23.90 each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50&ndash;99 units</td>\n<td>&euro;17.90</td>\n<td>&euro;5.50</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">&euro;23.40 each</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100+ units</td>\n<td>&euro;16.90</td>\n<td>&euro;5.00</td>\n<td class=\"cmp-kit-total\">$25.90 each</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cmp-note\">Free shipping on orders over $59 Professional design mockup always free, delivered in 1-2 days with free revisions.</p>\n<!-- COMPARISON TABLE -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2\">Full Comparison Table (2026)</h2>\n<div class=\"cmp-table-wrap\">\n<div class=\"table-scroll-wrapper\" style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n<table class=\"cmp-master-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Factor</th>\n<th>MOMUTO</th>\n<th>Jersix (EU/UK)</th>\n<th>Owayo (DE)</th>\n<th>Spized (DE)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Jersey Price (10 units)</td>\n<td>$25.90</td>\n<td>~&euro;29</td>\n<td>~&euro;43</td>\n<td>~&euro;41.90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Kit Price (10 units)</td>\n<td>$30.90</td>\n<td>~&euro;47</td>\n<td>~&euro;71</td>\n<td>~&euro;69</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delivery Time</td>\n<td>25&ndash;30 Days</td>\n<td>3&ndash;4 Weeks</td>\n<td>4&ndash;6 Weeks</td>\n<td>3&ndash;5 Weeks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order</td>\n<td>1 Unit</td>\n<td>10 Units</td>\n<td>1 Unit</td>\n<td>1 Unit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Free Shipping</td>\n<td>From $59</td>\n<td>Variable / High</td>\n<td>None (~&euro;4 min)</td>\n<td>None (~&euro;5 min)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Service</td>\n<td>Free Pro Designer + 3D Tool</td>\n<td>Included (often)</td>\n<td>DIY 3D Tool only</td>\n<td>DIY 3D Tool only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fabric</td>\n<td>Polyester + Elastane</td>\n<td>100% Polyester</td>\n<td>100% Polyester</td>\n<td>100% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing</td>\n<td>Full Sublimation</td>\n<td>Sublimation</td>\n<td>Sublimation</td>\n<td>Sublimation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D Silicon Badges</td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-check\">✓ Available</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-cross\">✗</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-cross\">✗</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"cmp-cross\">✗</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Production</td>\n<td>Tier-1 Factory, Asia*</td>\n<td>Europe (PL/IT)</td>\n<td>Germany</td>\n<td>Poland/EU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Languages</td>\n<td>EN, IT, FR, ES</td>\n<td>EN, FR</td>\n<td>DE, EN</td>\n<td>DE, EN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trustpilot Rating</td>\n<td>4.4 / 5</td>\n<td>4.7 / 5</td>\n<td>4.8 / 5</td>\n<td>4.9 / 5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cmp-note\">*Same manufacturing hub as other professional sportswear brands. Orders ship direct-from-factory to customer &mdash; no middleman, which is part of why delivery is faster.</p>\n<!-- ANALYSIS -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2 analysis-section\">Analysis by Use Case</h2>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">1. For Urgent Orders (Need kits in under 5 weeks)</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Winner: MOMUTO.</strong> At 25&ndash;30 days total, MOMUTO is the fastest option in this comparison. Jersix is competitive at 3&ndash;4 weeks but this can slip. Owayo and Spized regularly take 4&ndash;6 weeks. Crucially, MOMUTO ships direct from factory &mdash; there's no European warehouse adding a second transit leg.</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">2. For Small Teams (5-a-side, 7-a-side, social leagues)</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Winner: MOMUTO.</strong> A full kit (jersey + shorts) for a 10-player squad costs $30.90 per player at MOMUTO &mdash; designed free in the 3D configurator, or from a Ready-to-Play model at $27.80 Owayo and Spized apply surcharges to small orders that erode their advertised prices. Free shipping from $59 makes single-player orders viable too.</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">3. For Custom Design Capability</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Tie: MOMUTO &amp; Jersix.</strong> Both go beyond DIY templates. Jersix is known for creative output. MOMUTO matches this with a professional design studio ($15 deposit, fully credited to orders of 5+ jerseys) &mdash; plus a free real-time 3D configurator and studio-designed Ready-to-Play models for teams who prefer the fast lane. Owayo and Spized lock you into their configurator tools only.</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">4. For Material Quality</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Advantage: MOMUTO.</strong> The industry standard for custom kits is 100% polyester &mdash; it does the job, but it's a basic jersey feel. MOMUTO includes elastane in the standard fabric blend at no extra charge. This gives the kit stretch, shape retention, and the \"pro fit\" that competitors reserve for premium tiers.</p>\n<h3 class=\"cmp-h3\">5. For \"Made in Europe\" Requirements</h3>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Winner: Jersix or Owayo.</strong> If your club, federation, or grant program requires EU-manufactured goods, Jersix (Poland/Italy) or Owayo (Germany) are the right choice. MOMUTO manufactures in Asia, but this may not satisfy specific \"Made in EU\" compliance requirements.</p>\n<!-- GEO -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2\">Shipping to Italy, France, Spain &amp; Europe</h2>\n<div class=\"cmp-geo-section\">\n<h3>MOMUTO Ships Worldwide &mdash; Multilingual Support Included</h3>\n<div class=\"cmp-geo-grid\">\n<div class=\"cmp-geo-item\"><span class=\"flag\">🇮🇹</span>\n<div class=\"country\">Italy</div>\n<div class=\"detail\">Delivery 25&ndash;30 days. Support in Italian via WhatsApp &amp; email.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-geo-item\"><span class=\"flag\">🇫🇷</span>\n<div class=\"country\">France</div>\n<div class=\"detail\">Delivery 25&ndash;30 days. Support in French via WhatsApp &amp; email.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-geo-item\"><span class=\"flag\">🇪🇸</span>\n<div class=\"country\">Spain</div>\n<div class=\"detail\">Delivery 25&ndash;30 days. Support in Spanish via WhatsApp &amp; email.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cmp-geo-item\"><span class=\"flag\">🌍</span>\n<div class=\"country\">Rest of World</div>\n<div class=\"detail\">Delivery 25&ndash;30 days. English support available 7 days/week.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\">All European deliveries fall within the standard 25&ndash;30 day window. Customs clearance is included &mdash; no unexpected fees on arrival for EU customers.</p>\n<!-- VERDICT -->\n<h2 class=\"cmp-h2 verdict-section\">The Verdict: Which One Is Right for You?</h2>\n<div class=\"cmp-highlight-box\">\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Choose MOMUTO if:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You need reliable delivery in under 5 weeks.</li>\n<li>You want a full kit (jersey + shorts) for $30.90 per player at squad scale.</li>\n<li>You want premium polyester + elastane fabric at a standard price.</li>\n<li>You need a pro designer to handle the artwork (free, with revisions).</li>\n<li>You want optional 3D silicon badges &mdash; not available at competitors.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Choose Jersix if:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You specifically require EU production for grant or federation compliance.</li>\n<li>You already know their sizing from previous seasons.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Choose Owayo or Spized if:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You prefer to design entirely yourself using a DIY configurator.</li>\n<li>Time is not a factor and you have 6+ weeks before the season.</li>\n<li>\"Made in Germany/EU\" is a hard requirement.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p class=\"cmp-p\"><strong>Objective conclusion:</strong> For amateur teams, social leagues, esports orgs, and clubs across Europe looking for the best balance of speed, price, and quality in 2026, MOMUTO offers the most complete package &mdash; faster than the legacy German brands, more affordable at squad scale than all competitors, and the only supplier in this comparison offering elastane fabric and 3D silicon badges as standard options.</p>\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div class=\"cmp-cta-block\">\n<h3>Ready to design your kit?</h3>\n<p>Free design mockup in 1&ndash;2 days. No commitment until you order.</p>\n<a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"cmp-cta-btn\">Request a Custom Design</a> <a href=\"/pages/custom-kit-gallery\" class=\"cmp-cta-btn secondary\">View Kit Gallery</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
